Sugriva names elder Vali made king after their father --- Asura Mayavin challenges Vali by night for a woman --- Brothers chase the foe to a grass-hid pit --- Vali enters bidding Sugriva guard the door --- A year passes with Sugriva waiting --- Blood-foam and demon roars emerge from the cave --- Sugriva seals the cave and performs water-rites --- Ministers crown Sugriva as slayer Vali returns
